      "description": "日粒度院长驾驶舱出口（R13·§5.2.1 七字段对应五 KPI 卡）；异常预警面=退号率 RULE-HIS-001 阈值。ADS 实现=ads_dashboard_kpi。",
      "behavior": {
        "id": "BH-HIS-QueryDashboard",
        "name": "查询院长驾驶舱",
        "type": "QUERY",
        "triggerType": "",
        "ownerEntity": "AGG-HIS-001",
        "sourceNote": ""
      },
      "sourceObjects": [
        {
          "objectRef": "AGG-HIS-001",
          "alias": "r",
          "primary": true,
          "name": "挂号记录"
        },
        {
          "objectRef": "AGG-HIS-004",
          "alias": "p",
